        "sensemakingStrategy": "Formal definition anchored to prior observation (constructing explanations): learners move from empirical pattern-finding to formal language. The recurring-decimal conversion is a concrete bridge showing that repeating decimals are fractions in disguise, and Block 3 returns to the phenomenon so the vocabulary has a purpose.",
